---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="Privacy Policy">
  <div class="page-shell">
    <header class="page-head">
      <h1 class="page-title">
        <span class="text-white">Official</span> <span class="text-gold">Nugzz Crew</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="page-kicker">Privacy Policy</p>
      <p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm mt-2">Last updated: November 1, 2026</p>
    </header>

    <div class="space-y-6">
      <div class="bg-zinc-900/40 border border-zinc-800 rounded-2xl p-6 border-t-4 border-t-gold">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-header uppercase tracking-tight text-gold mb-3">1. Introduction</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base">
          Official Nugzz Crew (“we,” “us,” or “the Site”) operates officialnugzzcrew.com. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect information when you visit the Site or choose to sign in with Discord or Google/YouTube. We built this policy to be clear and straightforward for the Fam Bam.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-zinc-900/40 border border-zinc-800 rounded-2xl p-6 border-t-4 border-t-gold">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-header uppercase tracking-tight text-gold mb-3">2. Information We Collect</h2>
        <div class="text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base space-y-3">
          <p><strong class="text-white">Information you provide when signing in:</strong></p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 ml-2">
            <li>Discord: username, Discord ID, email address, avatar, and basic profile data provided by Discord OAuth</li>
            <li>Google / YouTube: name, email address, profile picture, and basic account information provided by Google OAuth</li>
          </ul>
          <p>We only request the minimum scopes needed to link your accounts for DMO ticket integration and live stream command features.</p>
          <p><strong class="text-white">Automatically collected information:</strong> Standard server logs (IP address, browser type, pages visited, timestamps). We do not use advertising cookies or third-party trackers beyond what is required for authentication.</p>
          <p><strong class="text-white">Optional information:</strong> Any additional details you voluntarily provide through forms, Discord tickets, or community features.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-zinc-900/40 border border-zinc-800 rounded-2xl p-6 border-t-4 border-t-gold">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-header uppercase tracking-tight text-gold mb-3">3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <ul class="text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base list-disc list-inside space-y-2">
          <li>To create and maintain your signed-in account on the Site</li>
          <li>To link your Discord and/or Google accounts for DMO ticket systems and live stream command features</li>
          <li>To operate, maintain, and improve the Site and community tools</li>
          <li>To respond to support requests or inquiries sent to nugzzcrew@gmail.com</li>
          <li>To prevent abuse, enforce our Terms of Service, and protect the community</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base mt-3">
          We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information. We do not use your data for advertising.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-zinc-900/40 border border-zinc-800 rounded-2xl p-6 border-t-4 border-t-gold">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-header uppercase tracking-tight text-gold mb-3">4. Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base">
          Authentication is handled through Discord and Google. When you sign in, you are subject to their respective privacy policies:
        </p>
        <ul class="text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base list-disc list-inside space-y-1 mt-2 ml-2">
          <li>Discord: <a href="https://discord.com/privacy" class="text-gold hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">discord.com/privacy</a></li>
          <li>Google: <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" class="text-gold hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">policies.google.com/privacy</a></li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base mt-3">
          We receive only the information those services explicitly provide based on the scopes you approve.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-zinc-900/40 border border-zinc-800 rounded-2xl p-6 border-t-4 border-t-gold">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-header uppercase tracking-tight text-gold mb-3">5. Data Retention & Security</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base">
          Account data is retained only as long as your account is active or as needed to provide the linked features. You may request deletion of your account and associated data at any time by contacting us. We use reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect information, but no method of transmission over the internet is 100% secure.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-zinc-900/40 border border-zinc-800 rounded-2xl p-6 border-t-4 border-t-gold">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-header uppercase tracking-tight text-gold mb-3">6. Your Rights</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base">
          Depending on your location, you may have rights to access, correct, delete, or restrict processing of your personal information. To exercise these rights, email us at <a href="mailto:nugzzcrew@gmail.com" class="text-gold hover:underline">nugzzcrew@gmail.com</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-zinc-900/40 border border-zinc-800 rounded-2xl p-6 border-t-4 border-t-gold">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-header uppercase tracking-tight text-gold mb-3">7. Children</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base">
          The Site is not directed at children under 13 (or the applicable age in your jurisdiction). We do not knowingly collect personal information from children.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-zinc-900/40 border border-zinc-800 rounded-2xl p-6 border-t-4 border-t-gold">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-header uppercase tracking-tight text-gold mb-3">8. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base">
          We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. The “Last updated” date at the top will reflect any changes. Continued use of the Site after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-zinc-900/40 border border-zinc-800 rounded-2xl p-6 border-t-4 border-t-gold">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-header uppercase tracking-tight text-gold mb-3">9. Contact Us</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base">
          Questions about this Privacy Policy or your data? Contact us at:<br>
          <a href="mailto:nugzzcrew@gmail.com" class="text-gold hover:underline font-medium">nugzzcrew@gmail.com</a>
        </p>
        <p class="text-zinc-400 text-xs mt-4">
          Official Nugzz Crew • officialnugzzcrew.com
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</MainLayout>